# What a merchant does NOT receive.
#
# This file has to live INSIDE the package directory, not only at the repository
# root: `git archive` reads .gitattributes from within the tree it is archiving,
# so in a monorepo a root-only file governs a whole-repo archive nobody
# publishes while every real per-package zip still ships everything below it.
# That mistake shipped a live admin password through three PrintifyCore
# releases before it was found.
Test/ export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
phpunit.xml.dist export-ignore
phpstan.neon.dist export-ignore
phpcs.xml.dist export-ignore
uat-runbook.md export-ignore

# M2MAP-598. The release gate is development tooling, and in a single-package
# repository the root IS the package - without this line every merchant would
# receive it. Asserted on the real archive by TheReleaseGateIsArmedTest.
.githooks/ export-ignore
